<string name="activityHelp">ACTIVITY HELP\n
\n
Settings:\n
Use this action to change default settings for the app.\n
\n
Exit:\n
Use this action to exit from the application.\n
</string>

<string name="settingsHelp">SETTINGS HELP\n
\n
Show Action Buttons:\n
Use this setting to show or not show the action buttons for the app.
All actions from the action buttons can be accessed by the same icon
 in the app menu bar at the top of the display.\n
\n
Date Formats:\n
Use this setting to change the date format when dates are displayed in the data view displays.\n
\n
</string>

<string name="locServiceHelp">LOCATION SERVICE HELP\n
\n
Location Service:\n
 The location service logs the app location when the app has been in one location. 
 The location service runs in the background and continues logging locations until the
 stop location logging button is clicked. If another member is logging locations, that
 service is stopped and a new location logging service is started for the current member.\n
\n
</string>

